# What `vercel deploy` from this folder must never upload. Vercel builds the demo, which
# reads only data/demo/index.json; this machine's own index (local paths, README text),
# the demo's clones and the film's sources stay here. .gitignore keeps them out of git;
# this keeps them out of a CLI upload too.
data/index.json
data/*.tmp
data/demo/*.tmp
.demo-cache
film
public/guide/innernet-explainer.mp4
.env*.local
